# comparators: three imports the library never declares, and a CHICKEN test header
#
# Two edits, and they are not equally clear-cut.
#
# **1. `comparators.sld` imports `(scheme base)` and `(scheme case-lambda)`
# and its body uses more.** `char-foldcase` and `string-foldcase` are
# `(scheme char)`'s, `nan?` is `(scheme inexact)`'s, and the complex
# comparator uses `(scheme complex)`. An implementation that enforces a
# library's import set - Patina does, R7RS 5.6 - finds them unbound the first
# time a comparator that needs one is built. A plain defect, and the package
# *passed* as an import probe while carrying it, because a probe calls
# nothing. The patch adds the three imports.
#
# **2. The test program is a CHICKEN script**:
#
#     (use test)
#     (use srfi-128)
#     (load "../comparators/r7rs-shim.scm")
#
# `use` is CHICKEN's, and the `load` reaches for a file beside a CHICKEN egg's
# layout. The body underneath is ordinary `test-group` / `test` / `test-assert`
# code, which is the API `(chibi test)` shares with CHICKEN's `test` egg - so
# the patch replaces those three lines with one R7RS `import` and leaves every
# assertion as written.
#
# **This second edit is the one that stretches the README's rule**, which is
# why it is called out: it ports a test's header rather than correcting a slip
# in it. It is admitted as the README's third shape because it touches only how
# the test *finds* its framework and its subject - no assertion, no expected
# value - and because without it 286 assertions about a SRFI 128 implementation
# never run anywhere.
#
# Measured after, both backends: **286 of 286**, across nine groups.
diff -ruN a/comparators.sld b/comparators.sld
--- a/comparators.sld
+++ b/comparators.sld
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 (define-library (comparators)
   (import (scheme base))
   (import (scheme case-lambda))
+  (import (scheme char) (scheme inexact) (scheme complex))
   (export comparator? comparator-ordered? comparator-hashable?)
   (export make-comparator
           make-pair-comparator make-list-comparator make-vector-comparator
diff -ruN a/srfi-128/comparators/comparators-test.scm b/srfi-128/comparators/comparators-test.scm
--- a/srfi-128/comparators/comparators-test.scm
+++ b/srfi-128/comparators/comparators-test.scm
@@ -1,6 +1,4 @@
-(use test)
-(use srfi-128)
-(load "../comparators/r7rs-shim.scm")
+(import (scheme base) (scheme write) (chibi test) (comparators))
 
 (define (print x) (display x) (newline))
 
